            "description": "\u003cp\u003eThis dataset geolocates playgrounds and play areas for children in New Zealand. These are typically areas with slides, swings, roundabouts, etc.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eIt is based on OpenStreetMap data, which is then compiled and processed by Opendatasoft. \nIt is updated weekly to retrieve the most recent OpenStreetMap elements. Fields prefixed with 'meta_' \nare additional information produced by ODS. These include data about the history of elements as well as their \nadministrative divisions. Other fields are based on the \u003ca href=\"https://geodatamine.fr/\"\u003eGeodatamine\u003c/a\u003e implementation.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eTags\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe OSM tags used to extract this data are: \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eleisure\u003c/code\u003e with the value 'playground'\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ename\u003c/code\u003e for the name\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003esurface\u003c/code\u003e for the surface type\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003emin_age\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003emax_age\u003c/code\u003e for the children's age range\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eopening_hours\u003c/code\u003e for opening hours\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eoperator\u003c/code\u003e for the operator or manager of the playground\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003efee\u003c/code\u003e to retrieve information about free access\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e Please note that this list is not exhaustive. \u003c/p\u003e",
            "description_en": "\u003cp\u003eThis dataset geolocates playgrounds and play areas for children in New Zealand. These are typically areas with slides, swings, roundabouts, etc.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eIt is based on OpenStreetMap data, which is then compiled and processed by Opendatasoft. \nIt is updated weekly to retrieve the most recent OpenStreetMap elements. Fields prefixed with 'meta_' \nare additional information produced by ODS. These include data about the history of elements as well as their \nadministrative divisions. Other fields are based on the \u003ca href=\"https://geodatamine.fr/\"\u003eGeodatamine\u003c/a\u003e implementation.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eTags\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe OSM tags used to extract this data are: \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eleisure\u003c/code\u003e with the value 'playground'\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ename\u003c/code\u003e for the name\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003esurface\u003c/code\u003e for the surface type\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003emin_age\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003emax_age\u003c/code\u003e for the children's age range\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eopening_hours\u003c/code\u003e for opening hours\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eoperator\u003c/code\u003e for the operator or manager of the playground\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003efee\u003c/code\u003e to retrieve information about free access\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e Please note that this list is not exhaustive. \u003c/p\u003e",
            "description_fr": "\u003cp\u003eThis dataset geolocates playgrounds and play areas for children in New Zealand. These are typically areas with slides, swings, roundabouts, etc.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eIt is based on OpenStreetMap data, which is then compiled and processed by Opendatasoft. \nIt is updated weekly to retrieve the most recent OpenStreetMap elements. Fields prefixed with 'meta_' \nare additional information produced by ODS. These include data about the history of elements as well as their \nadministrative divisions. Other fields are based on the \u003ca href=\"https://geodatamine.fr/\"\u003eGeodatamine\u003c/a\u003e implementation.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eTags\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe OSM tags used to extract this data are: \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eleisure\u003c/code\u003e with the value 'playground'\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ename\u003c/code\u003e for the name\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003esurface\u003c/code\u003e for the surface type\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003emin_age\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003emax_age\u003c/code\u003e for the children's age range\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eopening_hours\u003c/code\u003e for opening hours\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eoperator\u003c/code\u003e for the operator or manager of the playground\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003efee\u003c/code\u003e to retrieve information about free access\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e Please note that this list is not exhaustive. \u003c/p\u003e",
